  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Genuinely novel multimodal architecture fusing DNA and LLM reasoning — strong benchmark results (98.28% KEGG pathway accuracy) and NeurIPS 2025 pedigree. Apache-2.0, 387 stars, HuggingFace collection. Sits at the genomics-clinical boundary (similar to scGPT) so clinical adoption pathways are less direct than imaging or EHR tools. BioReason-Pro (ESM3 + RL) is already out from the same lab — monitor which version the community converges on before upgrading to Adopt.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-18",
